(1843672, 254563, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 10 because I love the processing alone.  Interesting mixture of clear sunset sky and a grungy foreground, truly a sunset scene of your own design plus perfectly fitting for the challenge.  Unique work.</td>', 'I''m giving this a 10 because I love the processing alone.  Interesting mixture of clear sunset sky and a grungy foreground, truly a sunset scene of your own design plus perfectly fitting for the challenge.  Unique work.', '2005-11-07 00:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
