(1843736, 254540, 10261, '<td valign="top">The sharp focus, deep DoF and noise-free presentation contrasts too much with the intended vintage look. I like the subject, but the post-processing gives the image an almost surreal feel which doesn''t really work for this challenge.</td>', 'The sharp focus, deep DoF and noise-free presentation contrasts too much with the intended vintage look. I like the subject, but the post-processing gives the image an almost surreal feel which doesn''t really work for this challenge.', '2005-11-07 00:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
