(1843746, 254236, 30861, '<td valign="top">That has GOT to be the strangest view of Half Dome I''ve ever seen reporduced, and beliwve me I have seen quite a few :-)  I''d love to see your "real" Yosemite shots from this jaunt, very promising sky.</td>', 'That has GOT to be the strangest view of Half Dome I''ve ever seen reporduced, and beliwve me I have seen quite a few :-)  I''d love to see your "real" Yosemite shots from this jaunt, very promising sky.', '2005-11-07 00:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843749, 253640, 35545, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, and worth what you''re paying for it, but I think you went overboard with the grain.  You''ve got good subject matter and good composition.  IMHO, the grain doesn''t add anything.  It might even detract.</td>', 'Just my opinion, and worth what you''re paying for it, but I think you went overboard with the grain.  You''ve got good subject matter and good composition.  IMHO, the grain doesn''t add anything.  It might even detract.', '2005-11-07 00:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
