(1843756, 252619, 6349, '<td valign="top">Oh, I gotta give this a 10 for the title alone! what a mood you''ve set.</td>', 'Oh, I gotta give this a 10 for the title alone! what a mood you''ve set.', '2005-11-07 00:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843759, 253818, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Too bad the upper right is blown out.</td>', 'Good composition.  Too bad the upper right is blown out.', '2005-11-07 00:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843761, 253650, 10261, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation can be a powerful compositional device, but this looks like a "because I can" use of the technique and detracts from the image. I think that partially desaturating the color on the rest of the image (rather than removing it entirely) would have directed the viewer''s attention without making the technique itself the focus.<br/></td>', 'Selective desaturation can be a powerful compositional device, but this looks like a "because I can" use of the technique and detracts from the image. I think that partially desaturating the color on the rest of the image (rather than removing it entirely) would have directed the viewer''s attention without making the technique itself the focus.', '2005-11-07 00:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843770, 253723, 35786, '<td valign="top">I of course don''t know (I''m no photoshop expert!) But... it looks like the sharpening went perfectly except on the left of the rim. I would have undone this with the history brush.<br/>If that''s not what happened, well then I just don''t like the white halo around that part... :0)<br/>7- because other than that it''s lovely.</td>', 'I of course don''t know (I''m no photoshop expert!) But... it looks like the sharpening went perfectly except on the left of the rim. I would have undone this with the history brush.If that''s not what happened, well then I just don''t like the white halo around that part... :0)7- because other than that it''s lovely.', '2005-11-07 00:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843774, 253499, 40019, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture!  Talk about being at the right place at the right time, with the right camera setting!  :-)  This should ribbon.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Outstanding capture!  Talk about being at the right place at the right time, with the right camera setting!  :-)  This should ribbon.  <10>', '2005-11-07 00:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843777, 254042, 35786, '<td valign="top">wow! incredible! I might have cropped a bit more but great capture!</td>', 'wow! incredible! I might have cropped a bit more but great capture!', '2005-11-07 00:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843779, 253887, 10261, '<td valign="top">The fuzzy vignetting is something typically reserved for pictures of weddings and puppies and smiling babies; using it here just seems bizarre. The busy pattern on the fabric behind the arm is distracting; a solid color located further behind the arm would have helped to direct attention to the intended subject.<br/> <br/>The subject itself is somewhat ambiguous. Is this person taking some necessary drug (e.g. insulin), some illicit substance, or is this an intended suicide? Although such ambiguity could create dramatic tension and make the image more interesting, I don''t think it works in your favor here.<br/></td>', 'The fuzzy vignetting is something typically reserved for pictures of weddings and puppies and smiling babies; using it here just seems bizarre. The busy pattern on the fabric behind the arm is distracting; a solid color located further behind the arm would have helped to direct attention to the intended subject. The subject itself is somewhat ambiguous. Is this person taking some necessary drug (e.g. insulin), some illicit substance, or is this an intended suicide? Although such ambiguity could create dramatic tension and make the image more interesting, I don''t think it works in your favor here.', '2005-11-07 00:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843784, 254362, 40019, '<td valign="top">I think I dated this girl once!  Love the humor (and seriousness).</td>', 'I think I dated this girl once!  Love the humor (and seriousness).', '2005-11-07 00:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
