(1843874, 253708, 10261, '<td valign="top">The low saturation on the sign contrasts too strongly with the relatively lush looking vegetation. Since this was an advanced editing challenge you might have tried masking the sign, inverting the selection and burning the background, then hue shifting the color of the sign toward a rusty red.<br/></td>', 'The low saturation on the sign contrasts too strongly with the relatively lush looking vegetation. Since this was an advanced editing challenge you might have tried masking the sign, inverting the selection and burning the background, then hue shifting the color of the sign toward a rusty red.', '2005-11-07 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
