(1843894, 253777, 10261, '<td valign="top">The idea is solid, but the colors are rather washed-out and the lighting seems too flat. Altering the saturation and contrast would have made this image significantly more interesting.<br/></td>', 'The idea is solid, but the colors are rather washed-out and the lighting seems too flat. Altering the saturation and contrast would have made this image significantly more interesting.', '2005-11-07 01:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843898, 253075, 10261, '<td valign="top">The image is nice, but you used way too much USM when sharpening this image. The colors on the near side of the truck also look odd. Did you pull all of that detail out of a nearly black shadow? Burning the sky a bit would have reinforced the moody feel of this image.<br/></td>', 'The image is nice, but you used way too much USM when sharpening this image. The colors on the near side of the truck also look odd. Did you pull all of that detail out of a nearly black shadow? Burning the sky a bit would have reinforced the moody feel of this image.', '2005-11-07 01:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843907, 253930, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but I would prefer to have a clear focal point (a bent license plate, discarded shoe, tire tracks, etc.). Adding noise was a good idea, but it looks like you compressed it too much. Since you''re still well under the 250K limit you would have been better off submitting a larger file with the noise intact.<br/></td>', 'I like this image, but I would prefer to have a clear focal point (a bent license plate, discarded shoe, tire tracks, etc.). Adding noise was a good idea, but it looks like you compressed it too much. Since you''re still well under the 250K limit you would have been better off submitting a larger file with the noise intact.', '2005-11-07 01:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843922, 254312, 10261, '<td valign="top">The border between the sky and the rest of the image is too sharp - try feathering your edges when you mask the sky. Since this was an advanced editing challenge, burning the sky to give it more depth would have been allowed. The DoF seems to be centered on the dogs; I think that the image would have been stronger if the focal point was the figure on the horse.<br/></td>', 'The border between the sky and the rest of the image is too sharp - try feathering your edges when you mask the sky. Since this was an advanced editing challenge, burning the sky to give it more depth would have been allowed. The DoF seems to be centered on the dogs; I think that the image would have been stronger if the focal point was the figure on the horse.', '2005-11-07 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843927, 251863, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, but it''s quite a stretch for the current challenge topic.<br/></td>', 'This is a nice image, but it''s quite a stretch for the current challenge topic.', '2005-11-07 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
