(1844125, 254480, 24940, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Geat lightitng.  Too much "open" space.  By ALL means, always try to avoid "up-the-nose" shots.</td>', 'Good idea.  Geat lightitng.  Too much "open" space.  By ALL means, always try to avoid "up-the-nose" shots.', '2005-11-07 06:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
