(1845011, 251665, 40977, '<td valign="top">Enjoy the tight crop/shot and spot on focus of this image. The slightly opened mouth adds to the mood.  Well done --8--</td>', 'Enjoy the tight crop/shot and spot on focus of this image. The slightly opened mouth adds to the mood.  Well done --8--', '2005-11-07 15:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845013, 253792, 40977, '<td valign="top">What a great image.  The colors contrast well.  Love the composition.  Some of the blades look bown out and the one the bug is on (on my screen) seems overprocessed.  Regardless the shot is well done.  --7--</td>', 'What a great image.  The colors contrast well.  Love the composition.  Some of the blades look bown out and the one the bug is on (on my screen) seems overprocessed.  Regardless the shot is well done.  --7--', '2005-11-07 15:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845022, 254354, 40977, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  A shot a truly wish I was creative enough to think of.  I cannot see anything technically wrong or that I would want to see different.  There were many directions you could have gone with this image and I think you completely nailed down the perfect tone and composition for this shot.  Great Job --10--</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  A shot a truly wish I was creative enough to think of.  I cannot see anything technically wrong or that I would want to see different.  There were many directions you could have gone with this image and I think you completely nailed down the perfect tone and composition for this shot.  Great Job --10--', '2005-11-07 15:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845025, 254082, 40977, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative and colorfull.  Great focus, crisp colors, and wonderfull composition.  Well Done --7--</td>', 'Wonderfully creative and colorfull.  Great focus, crisp colors, and wonderfull composition.  Well Done --7--', '2005-11-07 15:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845029, 253223, 40977, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfull dark image.  Love the reflection of the bars on the ground.  The prisoners expression all adds to the overall feel of the images.  Well Done --7--</td>', 'What a wonderfull dark image.  Love the reflection of the bars on the ground.  The prisoners expression all adds to the overall feel of the images.  Well Done --7--', '2005-11-07 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845035, 253780, 40977, '<td valign="top">I tried to do a similar shot and couldn''t get the lighting down the way you have with yours.  The tunnel and the shadowed image works well together and is enhanced by the sepia tone.  Well Done --7--</td>', 'I tried to do a similar shot and couldn''t get the lighting down the way you have with yours.  The tunnel and the shadowed image works well together and is enhanced by the sepia tone.  Well Done --7--', '2005-11-07 15:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845041, 252727, 40977, '<td valign="top">Different and I really like Different.  Great job on creating an image that holds the viewer''s attention.  Although the entire set up is amazing - I love the white shirt and the contrast that adds with the soil and the leaves.  Well Done --9--</td>', 'Different and I really like Different.  Great job on creating an image that holds the viewer''s attention.  Although the entire set up is amazing - I love the white shirt and the contrast that adds with the soil and the leaves.  Well Done --9--', '2005-11-07 15:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845046, 254205, 40977, '<td valign="top">Simple - Dark - and Well Done --7--</td>', 'Simple - Dark - and Well Done --7--', '2005-11-07 15:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845049, 253656, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  Like the light bleeding toward the camera.  Great take on the challenge.</td>', 'Great focus.  Like the light bleeding toward the camera.  Great take on the challenge.', '2005-11-07 15:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845058, 253966, 40977, '<td valign="top">I laughed and laughed when I first saw your entry.  What a great catch.  Focus is good.  Not sure if a closer shot (orientation) would have worked better with a little less of the clutter off to the left and right and more of the tracks and the barbed wire.  Regardless and image that holds the viewers attention and evokes feeling.  I think technically the picture is well done. -7--</td>', 'I laughed and laughed when I first saw your entry.  What a great catch.  Focus is good.  Not sure if a closer shot (orientation) would have worked better with a little less of the clutter off to the left and right and more of the tracks and the barbed wire.  Regardless and image that holds the viewers attention and evokes feeling.  I think technically the picture is well done. -7--', '2005-11-07 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845067, 254215, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Although I like the lighting, I find myself wishing I could see more details of the tunnel.  It appears cool and damp and is contrasted with the rays of light filtering in through the gates.  I like the overall composition of the shot. Good Job</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Although I like the lighting, I find myself wishing I could see more details of the tunnel.  It appears cool and damp and is contrasted with the rays of light filtering in through the gates.  I like the overall composition of the shot. Good Job', '2005-11-07 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845075, 253499, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  Love the image.  Great color - Sharp Focus - Love the Details. --8--</td>', 'Great catch.  Love the image.  Great color - Sharp Focus - Love the Details. --8--', '2005-11-07 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845104, 254562, 40977, '<td valign="top">"Gets the Bugs Out"  I love that it is simple but it also seems ill-placed.  Maybe a closer shot of just the top where "Combat" is written or using rules of third for placement.  Otherwise the shot is in focus and well done.</td>', '"Gets the Bugs Out"  I love that it is simple but it also seems ill-placed.  Maybe a closer shot of just the top where "Combat" is written or using rules of third for placement.  Otherwise the shot is in focus and well done.', '2005-11-07 15:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845106, 253721, 40977, '<td valign="top">What a great find.  I was searching for something along the same lines for my shot.  Congrats.  Love the composition and the color.  Well done.</td>', 'What a great find.  I was searching for something along the same lines for my shot.  Congrats.  Love the composition and the color.  Well done.', '2005-11-07 15:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845110, 254060, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great fall colors.  The soft focus works and your eyes are drawn down a pathway leading into the fall color trees.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Great fall colors.  The soft focus works and your eyes are drawn down a pathway leading into the fall color trees.  Nice shot.', '2005-11-07 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845115, 253341, 40977, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but it seems a little overprocessed.  I think you have a good eye and would love to see this same shot a little more natural looking.  Otherwise the expression, composition, and overall mood is excellent.</td>', 'I like this image, but it seems a little overprocessed.  I think you have a good eye and would love to see this same shot a little more natural looking.  Otherwise the expression, composition, and overall mood is excellent.', '2005-11-07 15:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845118, 253403, 40977, '<td valign="top">Oh my -- wouldn''t want that to be my bus stop.  Great find.  Love the red agains the blue cool sky.  The border is a little to think (imo) for the shot.  Otherwise, I also like the composition and placement of the stop in the frame.  Well done.</td>', 'Oh my -- wouldn''t want that to be my bus stop.  Great find.  Love the red agains the blue cool sky.  The border is a little to think (imo) for the shot.  Otherwise, I also like the composition and placement of the stop in the frame.  Well done.', '2005-11-07 15:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845121, 254518, 40977, '<td valign="top">Wicked !!  It was the witches end, but Dorothy''s beginning.  Great color and love the added fall leaves.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wicked !!  It was the witches end, but Dorothy''s beginning.  Great color and love the added fall leaves.  Nice job.', '2005-11-07 15:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845125, 251665, 40718, '<td valign="top">I have this as a ribbon winner.  Technicals are flawless, coloring is sweet, DOF is perfect.  A great capture.  2 10s in this challenge, this is 1.</td>', 'I have this as a ribbon winner.  Technicals are flawless, coloring is sweet, DOF is perfect.  A great capture.  2 10s in this challenge, this is 1.', '2005-11-07 15:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845127, 254414, 40977, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it''s the simple images that most miss that fits the challenge better than some.  I like the composition and the focus is spot on.  I don''t know what the color version looked liked, but have to admit that with the advance editting, I might have taken a stab at editing the color version of this image to make a more appealing shot.  Regardless the image is well done.</td>', 'Sometimes it''s the simple images that most miss that fits the challenge better than some.  I like the composition and the focus is spot on.  I don''t know what the color version looked liked, but have to admit that with the advance editting, I might have taken a stab at editing the color version of this image to make a more appealing shot.  Regardless the image is well done.', '2005-11-07 16:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845128, 252884, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  I''ll tell you I am another "bug dead end" interpretation (but I won''t say which one).  I enjoy your''s a lot.  The composition is simple and elegant.  The diagonal swoop of the branch is pleasing.  The focus is sharp and the lighting is impeccable.  I''ll give you a 10.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  I''ll tell you I am another "bug dead end" interpretation (but I won''t say which one).  I enjoy your''s a lot.  The composition is simple and elegant.  The diagonal swoop of the branch is pleasing.  The focus is sharp and the lighting is impeccable.  I''ll give you a 10.', '2005-11-07 16:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845133, 252727, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the work a lot.  The 90 degree canvas shift makes for an interesting composition.  The processing, I think adds quite a bit, but I can be a fan of quality heavy processing. 9</td>', 'I like the work a lot.  The 90 degree canvas shift makes for an interesting composition.  The processing, I think adds quite a bit, but I can be a fan of quality heavy processing. 9', '2005-11-07 16:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845141, 253499, 40718, '<td valign="top">A great capture.  Was the white on the ladybugs naturally that shade of orange or is it bleed from post-processing?  That''s my biggest complaint and you might not even have had anything to do with it.  I''ll tell you I have another of the "bug dead end" pics and was hoping to use ladybugs, but couldn''t find any. :( 9</td>', 'A great capture.  Was the white on the ladybugs naturally that shade of orange or is it bleed from post-processing?  That''s my biggest complaint and you might not even have had anything to do with it.  I''ll tell you I have another of the "bug dead end" pics and was hoping to use ladybugs, but couldn''t find any. :( 9', '2005-11-07 16:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845144, 254192, 40718, '<td valign="top">The composition with the leading line going to the top corner is appealing.  The selective desat is subtle and works.  Would it have been possible to remove the piece of machinery in the boat before the pic?  It''s minimally distracting. 8</td>', 'The composition with the leading line going to the top corner is appealing.  The selective desat is subtle and works.  Would it have been possible to remove the piece of machinery in the boat before the pic?  It''s minimally distracting. 8', '2005-11-07 16:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845147, 254540, 40718, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of sepia.  The composition is well done and the lighting is excellent. 8</td>', 'Wonderful use of sepia.  The composition is well done and the lighting is excellent. 8', '2005-11-07 16:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845151, 253958, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice and smooth feel.  The lighting is very well done.  I don''t mind center composition pictures and the harness adds to a bit of imbalance anyway. 8</td>', 'Nice and smooth feel.  The lighting is very well done.  I don''t mind center composition pictures and the harness adds to a bit of imbalance anyway. 8', '2005-11-07 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845152, 254192, 40977, '<td valign="top">Really am a big fan of selective desat.  Great image.  Well Done</td>', 'Really am a big fan of selective desat.  Great image.  Well Done', '2005-11-07 16:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845155, 254342, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love the pink and yellow colors and the whole setting.  I''m not sure about the title, but I rarely count that against people.  One thing you might have tried to do was ask her to take down the "go hens" sign.  It''s mega-distracting as it''s very primary versus the pastel colors of the rest of the shot.  You might have cloned it out with some careful work. 8</td>', 'I love the pink and yellow colors and the whole setting.  I''m not sure about the title, but I rarely count that against people.  One thing you might have tried to do was ask her to take down the "go hens" sign.  It''s mega-distracting as it''s very primary versus the pastel colors of the rest of the shot.  You might have cloned it out with some careful work. 8', '2005-11-07 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845158, 253964, 40718, '<td valign="top">My entry was almost the end of a dock looking very similar to this one.  I''m glad I didn''t use it because this is, by far, superior.  The gulls add quite a bit and I like the very mild sepia. 8</td>', 'My entry was almost the end of a dock looking very similar to this one.  I''m glad I didn''t use it because this is, by far, superior.  The gulls add quite a bit and I like the very mild sepia. 8', '2005-11-07 16:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845163, 254346, 40977, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge and I think there is an image there that would be more impactfull.  I think this might have been the wrong lens/angle for the job.  The color and the focus are spot on.  I also like the creativity and direction you were going with this idea.  The border works with the shot, but maybe some level adjustments and midtone/shadow adjustments would have bettered the image.  Nice job</td>', 'Fits the challenge and I think there is an image there that would be more impactfull.  I think this might have been the wrong lens/angle for the job.  The color and the focus are spot on.  I also like the creativity and direction you were going with this idea.  The border works with the shot, but maybe some level adjustments and midtone/shadow adjustments would have bettered the image.  Nice job', '2005-11-07 16:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845166, 254264, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Love the red wagon against the blue sky.  The focus and composition is well done.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great colors.  Love the red wagon against the blue sky.  The focus and composition is well done.  Nice job.', '2005-11-07 16:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845172, 253902, 40977, '<td valign="top">I think there is a bit too much going on in this shot to hold the viewers attention.  I like the colors and possibly the angle, but would have liked to see some midtone adjustments and maybe even some shadow to make the fall colors pop a bit.  Just a bit more "it" factor and imo you would have had an excellent shot.  Look forward to seeing more.</td>', 'I think there is a bit too much going on in this shot to hold the viewers attention.  I like the colors and possibly the angle, but would have liked to see some midtone adjustments and maybe even some shadow to make the fall colors pop a bit.  Just a bit more "it" factor and imo you would have had an excellent shot.  Look forward to seeing more.', '2005-11-07 16:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845173, 254478, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I like the reflections in the sign and the red tones you choose to use.  The perspective is an added bonus in this challenge.  Well Done.</td>', 'Great shot - I like the reflections in the sign and the red tones you choose to use.  The perspective is an added bonus in this challenge.  Well Done.', '2005-11-07 16:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845179, 253467, 40977, '<td valign="top">A+ on creativity.  I also love the colors and the selective desat.  Everything works--  The abadoned feeling on the setting and the images work well to create an erie mood.  Well done.</td>', 'A+ on creativity.  I also love the colors and the selective desat.  Everything works--  The abadoned feeling on the setting and the images work well to create an erie mood.  Well done.', '2005-11-07 16:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845194, 254315, 40718, '<td valign="top">I keep bumping this one up.  At first I didn''t like it, but the composition is well done.  I don''t really like the title, but I try not to hold that against people.  It''s a pretty loose interpretation of "dead end", but I''m taking all comers this challenge.  The best part is how the lines frame and trap the subject. 7</td>', 'I keep bumping this one up.  At first I didn''t like it, but the composition is well done.  I don''t really like the title, but I try not to hold that against people.  It''s a pretty loose interpretation of "dead end", but I''m taking all comers this challenge.  The best part is how the lines frame and trap the subject. 7', '2005-11-07 16:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845198, 253354, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a great dreary feeling accomplished by the muted colors and the industrial subject. 7</td>', 'Nice composition and a great dreary feeling accomplished by the muted colors and the industrial subject. 7', '2005-11-07 16:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845202, 254264, 40718, '<td valign="top">How could we have 3 wagons in this challenge?  Weird.  The colors on the wagon are nice in this one.  The composition is a little tough with the wagon being hemmed in by the brush (which is less appealing it its dark muddy color and texture), but there was probably little you could have done to fix that. 7</td>', 'How could we have 3 wagons in this challenge?  Weird.  The colors on the wagon are nice in this one.  The composition is a little tough with the wagon being hemmed in by the brush (which is less appealing it its dark muddy color and texture), but there was probably little you could have done to fix that. 7', '2005-11-07 16:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845205, 253833, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice composition.  Centered works here.  The ghostly lighting on the figure is a nice touch. 7</td>', 'A nice composition.  Centered works here.  The ghostly lighting on the figure is a nice touch. 7', '2005-11-07 16:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845207, 253843, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m pretty bad at putting pictures with people, but this looks like something Jutilda would do.  The processing looks dreamy and the whole picture is nostalgic with the muted colors. 7</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m pretty bad at putting pictures with people, but this looks like something Jutilda would do.  The processing looks dreamy and the whole picture is nostalgic with the muted colors. 7', '2005-11-07 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845212, 253625, 40718, '<td valign="top">We seem to see a fair amount of naked people in the corner entries as time goes by.  I''m usually not a fan, but I like this one.  The burn works as does the texture of the walls. 7</td>', 'We seem to see a fair amount of naked people in the corner entries as time goes by.  I''m usually not a fan, but I like this one.  The burn works as does the texture of the walls. 7', '2005-11-07 16:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845215, 253499, 31399, '<td valign="top">nice idea 8</td>', 'nice idea 8', '2005-11-07 16:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845218, 251665, 31399, '<td valign="top">nice colors and focus. 8</td>', 'nice colors and focus. 8', '2005-11-07 16:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845220, 254528, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I would have liked to see a B&amp;W version, but the sepia isn''t bad.    I like the subject and composition.  Perhaps dodge the highlight on the boat on the left.  It''s a bit distracting, but no biggie. 7</td>', 'Hmmm, I would have liked to see a B&W version, but the sepia isn''t bad.    I like the subject and composition.  Perhaps dodge the highlight on the boat on the left.  It''s a bit distracting, but no biggie. 7', '2005-11-07 16:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845225, 254417, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is one of the two highest "graveyard" pictures in my opinion.  It''s always nice to be at the top of your genre.  The reds are nice.  The shadow on the lower 10th of the picture is too bad and I wish another time of day could have given you more luck.  On the other hand, the long shadows of the stones are nice. 7</td>', 'This is one of the two highest "graveyard" pictures in my opinion.  It''s always nice to be at the top of your genre.  The reds are nice.  The shadow on the lower 10th of the picture is too bad and I wish another time of day could have given you more luck.  On the other hand, the long shadows of the stones are nice. 7', '2005-11-07 16:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845227, 254424, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The sign might be a little too bright and competes too much with the sunset. 7</td>', 'Nice composition.  The sign might be a little too bright and competes too much with the sunset. 7', '2005-11-07 16:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845231, 252202, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like this the best among "graveyard" entries.  Hope people understand the title and don''t just think "the movie".  The swath of leaves in the foreground is what makes this pic.  I also like the way the stones are separated and isolated from us as a further metaphorical way of damning the dead. 7</td>', 'I like this the best among "graveyard" entries.  Hope people understand the title and don''t just think "the movie".  The swath of leaves in the foreground is what makes this pic.  I also like the way the stones are separated and isolated from us as a further metaphorical way of damning the dead. 7', '2005-11-07 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845234, 254077, 40718, '<td valign="top">Creative.  Technicals are quite above average, but perhaps not perfect. (the small flare on the right edge)  I like the composition too. 7</td>', 'Creative.  Technicals are quite above average, but perhaps not perfect. (the small flare on the right edge)  I like the composition too. 7', '2005-11-07 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845235, 254362, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cute and creative.  The title might have been more creative, but I won''t hold that against you. 7</td>', 'Cute and creative.  The title might have been more creative, but I won''t hold that against you. 7', '2005-11-07 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845236, 253497, 40718, '<td valign="top">Good job with the reflective surfaces.  Nice balance to the still life composition. Lighting is nice. 7</td>', 'Good job with the reflective surfaces.  Nice balance to the still life composition. Lighting is nice. 7', '2005-11-07 16:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845240, 254393, 40718, '<td valign="top">I tend to like this dreamy look Neat Image is often utilized to capture.  It adds to the photo which might have been a bit mundane without.  The composition is nicely imbalanced.  The trees in the distance probably are the element that makes the picture what it is. 7</td>', 'I tend to like this dreamy look Neat Image is often utilized to capture.  It adds to the photo which might have been a bit mundane without.  The composition is nicely imbalanced.  The trees in the distance probably are the element that makes the picture what it is. 7', '2005-11-07 16:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845242, 254425, 40718, '<td valign="top">Dang spelling.  Won''t hold it against you.  It''s an arresting "snapshot".  While we tend to poo-poo those and the word is usually used critically on this site, there are times when a shapshot still conveys oomph (usually relies on the subject).  I''d say this fits the bill. 7</td>', 'Dang spelling.  Won''t hold it against you.  It''s an arresting "snapshot".  While we tend to poo-poo those and the word is usually used critically on this site, there are times when a shapshot still conveys oomph (usually relies on the subject).  I''d say this fits the bill. 7', '2005-11-07 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845245, 254518, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Nicely colored.  If this wasn''t for Halloween, kudos for the setup work for the challenge. 7</td>', 'Cute.  Nicely colored.  If this wasn''t for Halloween, kudos for the setup work for the challenge. 7', '2005-11-07 16:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845247, 254290, 40718, '<td valign="top">The snow adds to the desolation feel.  The composition is nice and you did well keeping the dynamic range under control. 7</td>', 'The snow adds to the desolation feel.  The composition is nice and you did well keeping the dynamic range under control. 7', '2005-11-07 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845248, 253575, 40718, '<td valign="top">I bumped this up.  Arresting composition.  7</td>', 'I bumped this up.  Arresting composition.  7', '2005-11-07 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
