(1845414, 253780, 24454, '<td valign="top">Powerful image!   I wish there was a little more detail in the guy, but I really love it anyway.     Great job.</td>', 'Powerful image!   I wish there was a little more detail in the guy, but I really love it anyway.     Great job.', '2005-11-07 18:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845421, 253721, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that really appeals to me.   Maybe its the contrast between the obvious "dead end" and accompanying dead brush, and the pretty fall colors.  I think you''ve also done a great job editing.   Good luck!</td>', 'There''s something about this that really appeals to me.   Maybe its the contrast between the obvious "dead end" and accompanying dead brush, and the pretty fall colors.  I think you''ve also done a great job editing.   Good luck!', '2005-11-07 18:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
