(1845432, 254412, 45672, '<td valign="top">Really really cool shot, it looks more like a beginning than an end, but I really like this one.</td>', 'Really really cool shot, it looks more like a beginning than an end, but I really like this one.', '2005-11-07 18:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845433, 254312, 24454, '<td valign="top">Even tho the thought of all those dogs chasing a single fox to it''s death  makes me sick to my stomach, this is a very pretty picture.   I just won''t think about what it represents.</td>', 'Even tho the thought of all those dogs chasing a single fox to it''s death  makes me sick to my stomach, this is a very pretty picture.   I just won''t think about what it represents.', '2005-11-07 18:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
