(1845456, 254236, 45672, '<td valign="top">Really great shot.  I love yosemite.  Have you climbed Halfdome yet?  It is great!  I saw a great t-shirt a long time ago and it said in BIG letters "I climbed Halfdome" and in small letters in between climbed and Halfdome it said "out of my car to take a picture of".</td>', 'Really great shot.  I love yosemite.  Have you climbed Halfdome yet?  It is great!  I saw a great t-shirt a long time ago and it said in BIG letters "I climbed Halfdome" and in small letters in between climbed and Halfdome it said "out of my car to take a picture of".', '2005-11-07 18:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845483, 253499, 32767, '<td valign="top">Falc? Maybe? I like the image overall but not too crazy about the dof. Should do well regardless. Good Luck!</td>', 'Falc? Maybe? I like the image overall but not too crazy about the dof. Should do well regardless. Good Luck!', '2005-11-07 18:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
