(1845521, 252660, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. I especially like the coppered toning. BTW, let me know what filter(s) you used to get this effect after the voting, please. Good Luck! 9</td>', 'Great perspective. I especially like the coppered toning. BTW, let me know what filter(s) you used to get this effect after the voting, please. Good Luck! 9', '2005-11-07 18:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
