(1845693, 253782, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is terrifying and brings out big emotions in me, being the mother of a daughter and the fear this envokes.  It''s very well done.....looks like a scene from a movie.</td>', 'This is terrifying and brings out big emotions in me, being the mother of a daughter and the fear this envokes.  It''s very well done.....looks like a scene from a movie.', '2005-11-07 19:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845711, 254480, 6999, '<td valign="top">Yep - to live is to die. I find the processing enormously overdone here. Composition is fine, in a kind of stock manner, and the smoke is well brought out.</td>', 'Yep - to live is to die. I find the processing enormously overdone here. Composition is fine, in a kind of stock manner, and the smoke is well brought out.', '2005-11-07 19:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845720, 254122, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh - I was getting fed up with too many nonsense shots in this challenge, but this I like. It has a 60''s filmic quality that is very well done, and a sense of the (extra)ordinary that sits very well with me. The sparrows add a near-surreal touch. what, by orthodix thinking, ought to be very poor light, wrks well to flatten and geometricise the scene, and there''s a certain balance to the compositional weight that pleases me. Nice work</td>', 'Oh - I was getting fed up with too many nonsense shots in this challenge, but this I like. It has a 60''s filmic quality that is very well done, and a sense of the (extra)ordinary that sits very well with me. The sparrows add a near-surreal touch. what, by orthodix thinking, ought to be very poor light, wrks well to flatten and geometricise the scene, and there''s a certain balance to the compositional weight that pleases me. Nice work', '2005-11-07 19:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1845810, 254482, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I gotta give this a pretty low score.  Not really on the meets challenge front (although it''s a real stretch), but it''s advanced editing and she still has redeye.  That just tells me not a lot of effor went into this one...</td>', 'Well, I gotta give this a pretty low score.  Not really on the meets challenge front (although it''s a real stretch), but it''s advanced editing and she still has redeye.  That just tells me not a lot of effor went into this one...', '2005-11-07 20:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
