(1847770, 254060, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is nice. The colors are great. Being centered works with this shot. I like the softness also.</td>', 'This is nice. The colors are great. Being centered works with this shot. I like the softness also.', '2005-11-08 15:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847773, 254562, 10263, '<td valign="top">It is indeed a dead end. The photo isn''t very interesting to me though. Placing an ant or two (or whatever kinda bug it is for) in the photo would have made a nice impact though.</td>', 'It is indeed a dead end. The photo isn''t very interesting to me though. Placing an ant or two (or whatever kinda bug it is for) in the photo would have made a nice impact though.', '2005-11-08 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
