(1847979, 254312, 36988, '<td valign="top">A very imaginative and unique approach to this challenge... meeting it very well. Excellent job with color, crop and comp. No negatives here and a 10 in my book... :)</td>', 'A very imaginative and unique approach to this challenge... meeting it very well. Excellent job with color, crop and comp. No negatives here and a 10 in my book... :)', '2005-11-08 18:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
