(1851176, 254009, 25655, '<td valign="top">The fall colors... how beautiful! I just love the tones of this image!!<br/>I got so tired from the drugs and road signs in this challenge, that this is a lot more then just a refreshing view for me!!<br/>As a matter of fact, I see five ends here. Not only three: end of road, end of summer in the air, end of season for the tree, end of the day, and the broken lines of the fence also have a dead-end feel as no one will even make them one fluent line. <br/>I do however wonder how many people will actually get that... <br/> <br/>One of the best out-of-the-box photos in this challenge and a personal favorite!<br/>Thank you!</td>', 'The fall colors... how beautiful! I just love the tones of this image!!I got so tired from the drugs and road signs in this challenge, that this is a lot more then just a refreshing view for me!!As a matter of fact, I see five ends here. Not only three: end of road, end of summer in the air, end of season for the tree, end of the day, and the broken lines of the fence also have a dead-end feel as no one will even make them one fluent line. I do however wonder how many people will actually get that...  One of the best out-of-the-box photos in this challenge and a personal favorite!Thank you!', '2005-11-09 13:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
