(1856581, 254139, 16488, '<td valign="top">Cute and funny! That red has a lot of pop! I find the sharpening around the edges of the cheese slightly distracting. Wish you''d left only the little pieces of cheese outside the mousetrap--the larger one out there gives away the set-up too much because I think the mouse would be full before he took the bait.</td>', 'Cute and funny! That red has a lot of pop! I find the sharpening around the edges of the cheese slightly distracting. Wish you''d left only the little pieces of cheese outside the mousetrap--the larger one out there gives away the set-up too much because I think the mouse would be full before he took the bait.', '2005-11-10 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
