(1856866, 254144, 12243, '<td valign="top">awww that poor little thing. Hope someone gave him a great burial. Nice toning and effect. End of days exist even for little ones. 10 from me.</td>', 'awww that poor little thing. Hope someone gave him a great burial. Nice toning and effect. End of days exist even for little ones. 10 from me.', '2005-11-10 22:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
