(1856958, 254009, 43031, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the colors that you have here, the wonderful perspective and use of DOF to keep your eyes going further down the path and away from the edges of the photo.</td>', 'I absolutely love the colors that you have here, the wonderful perspective and use of DOF to keep your eyes going further down the path and away from the edges of the photo.', '2005-11-10 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
