(1856966, 254499, 43031, '<td valign="top">I made a 9 vote on a snap jusdgement and moved on to see if I still felt the same coming back. I do. thesmall subject (well placed I might add) and viewpoint create a sense that I am looking from the eyes of a predator. very emotive and well processed.</td>', 'I made a 9 vote on a snap jusdgement and moved on to see if I still felt the same coming back. I do. thesmall subject (well placed I might add) and viewpoint create a sense that I am looking from the eyes of a predator. very emotive and well processed.', '2005-11-10 22:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856976, 253575, 10263, '<td valign="top">This one makes me sad.  Its a great shot in all respects. The expression on the girls face is perfect. She truly looks desparate.</td>', 'This one makes me sad.  Its a great shot in all respects. The expression on the girls face is perfect. She truly looks desparate.', '2005-11-10 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856988, 254486, 43031, '<td valign="top">I love clue. the placement of items seems a little... i dunno, just a little flat. I''m not sure if I''m looking at the checklist card or the the clue cards. probably because the checklist has so little visual weight from it low saturation. maybe not taking the photo straight on, and looking at a n angle with the checklist in focus and larger in the frame... I don''t care. I love clue.</td>', 'I love clue. the placement of items seems a little... i dunno, just a little flat. I''m not sure if I''m looking at the checklist card or the the clue cards. probably because the checklist has so little visual weight from it low saturation. maybe not taking the photo straight on, and looking at a n angle with the checklist in focus and larger in the frame... I don''t care. I love clue.', '2005-11-10 23:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856995, 254256, 10263, '<td valign="top">I like this. The muted tones everywhere around the red door is striking. Makes me want to know more about the situation. I want to know what that door represents to her.</td>', 'I like this. The muted tones everywhere around the red door is striking. Makes me want to know more about the situation. I want to know what that door represents to her.', '2005-11-10 23:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857003, 254502, 43031, '<td valign="top">I really like the detial and the colors here. the leading lines are great, and get you to the red.. that''s where I''m (visually) lost. The red (door? monument? temple?) needs something to bring it out more. possibly some dodging could help.</td>', 'I really like the detial and the colors here. the leading lines are great, and get you to the red.. that''s where I''m (visually) lost. The red (door? monument? temple?) needs something to bring it out more. possibly some dodging could help.', '2005-11-10 23:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
