(1857386, 254205, 37893, '<td valign="top">Simple. Starck. Effective. I love the minimalism and message this image portrays :) 7</td>', 'Simple. Starck. Effective. I love the minimalism and message this image portrays :) 7', '2005-11-11 02:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857390, 254562, 47085, '<td valign="top">hmmm...</td>', 'hmmm...', '2005-11-11 02:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857433, 252727, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  The soiled and partly ''buried'' body recalls organic decomposition; the ultimate ''dead end''.  But that''s not all ... there''s at least one other whole level of meaning to explore; the deep drift of autumn leaves provides another kind of ''dead end''.  And then there''s the clever title, which seems to be a sly reference to both of these interpretations of the image; the body falling to dust, and the fall leaves.  Brilliantly conceived and superbly executed - it''s original, thoughtful and technically excellent, and it''s awfully rare to get all three of those together here!  10.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  The soiled and partly ''buried'' body recalls organic decomposition; the ultimate ''dead end''.  But that''s not all ... there''s at least one other whole level of meaning to explore; the deep drift of autumn leaves provides another kind of ''dead end''.  And then there''s the clever title, which seems to be a sly reference to both of these interpretations of the image; the body falling to dust, and the fall leaves.  Brilliantly conceived and superbly executed - it''s original, thoughtful and technically excellent, and it''s awfully rare to get all three of those together here!  10.', '2005-11-11 03:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857465, 252660, 39483, '<td valign="top">I work in a science museum where we have optical illusions as exhibits and I have to say that your photo actually creates a tremendous amount of movement illusion. Well done! Nice lighting and subdued colors. I also like the low angle...</td>', 'I work in a science museum where we have optical illusions as exhibits and I have to say that your photo actually creates a tremendous amount of movement illusion. Well done! Nice lighting and subdued colors. I also like the low angle...', '2005-11-11 04:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857467, 254518, 39483, '<td valign="top">That yellow brick road looks familiar :) Great humor in this photo and well shot (I like the low angle)! Nice concept as well! Good luck!</td>', 'That yellow brick road looks familiar :) Great humor in this photo and well shot (I like the low angle)! Nice concept as well! Good luck!', '2005-11-11 04:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857469, 253833, 39483, '<td valign="top">That figure seems almost ghostly! Nice lighting and framing of the doors! well done</td>', 'That figure seems almost ghostly! Nice lighting and framing of the doors! well done', '2005-11-11 04:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857470, 253575, 39483, '<td valign="top">Very arresting image! Well shot and composed.</td>', 'Very arresting image! Well shot and composed.', '2005-11-11 04:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857471, 253780, 39483, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and concept. IMHO, I might have cropped it more on the left side so the back fo the figure is against the edge of the photo and hence against the wall more... well done!</td>', 'Nice silhouette and concept. IMHO, I might have cropped it more on the left side so the back fo the figure is against the edge of the photo and hence against the wall more... well done!', '2005-11-11 04:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857472, 252727, 39483, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about an arresting image! Amazing shot, I really like the way you dirtied the shirt to blend it with the leaves. How did you get your legs to fade in or are they just buried? good luck!</td>', 'Wow, talk about an arresting image! Amazing shot, I really like the way you dirtied the shirt to blend it with the leaves. How did you get your legs to fade in or are they just buried? good luck!', '2005-11-11 04:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857473, 253569, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing on this image and the colors! IMHO, I might have cropped the top part of the tree a bit so the eyes focus on the railroad more... well done!</td>', 'I really like the processing on this image and the colors! IMHO, I might have cropped the top part of the tree a bit so the eyes focus on the railroad more... well done!', '2005-11-11 04:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857474, 252559, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image with the ''window'' ... and the top and right end side help frame the photo but IMHO, I might have cropped the bottom ''ground'' part to make the photo less anchored and more puzzling? just a thought...</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image with the ''window'' ... and the top and right end side help frame the photo but IMHO, I might have cropped the bottom ''ground'' part to make the photo less anchored and more puzzling? just a thought...', '2005-11-11 04:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857476, 252441, 39483, '<td valign="top">Nice and different viewpoint! It might have been nice to see a shot with longer shadows? well done!</td>', 'Nice and different viewpoint! It might have been nice to see a shot with longer shadows? well done!', '2005-11-11 04:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857478, 254483, 39483, '<td valign="top">Wow, great composotion and candid shot! I really like the multi locks on the door and the figure seemingly waiting for the key bearer... Minor detail but IMHO, the bottom left hand shadow is a tad distracting, not sure you could have done anything. Well done!</td>', 'Wow, great composotion and candid shot! I really like the multi locks on the door and the figure seemingly waiting for the key bearer... Minor detail but IMHO, the bottom left hand shadow is a tad distracting, not sure you could have done anything. Well done!', '2005-11-11 04:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857479, 254073, 39483, '<td valign="top">what amazing light capture! and great ''poses'', the right one does seem to be running for his life! :) well composed!</td>', 'what amazing light capture! and great ''poses'', the right one does seem to be running for his life! :) well composed!', '2005-11-11 05:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
