(1859573, 253837, 41675, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t get the connection between a cupie doll with Groucho marx sunglasses and dead end..unless ofcourse this refers to the past challenges where a cupie doll has also shown up?</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t get the connection between a cupie doll with Groucho marx sunglasses and dead end..unless ofcourse this refers to the past challenges where a cupie doll has also shown up?', '2005-11-11 23:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859577, 252554, 41675, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, your photo is coming across extremely pixelated on my screen. Also, the lack of focus makes it hard for my eyes to discern exactly what the subject matter, which in turns makes it hard for me to judge it in this Dead End challenge.</td>', 'Unfortunately, your photo is coming across extremely pixelated on my screen. Also, the lack of focus makes it hard for my eyes to discern exactly what the subject matter, which in turns makes it hard for me to judge it in this Dead End challenge.', '2005-11-11 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859578, 252553, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the winding path, but for me, I feel it continues on to yet another peaceful, winding turn instead of a dead end. I also wonder how this would look with a bit more saturation and brightness - to help the fall colors "pop" a bit more.</td>', 'I like the winding path, but for me, I feel it continues on to yet another peaceful, winding turn instead of a dead end. I also wonder how this would look with a bit more saturation and brightness - to help the fall colors "pop" a bit more.', '2005-11-11 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859580, 251863, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up a pont after second look. I like the blue lights of the bridge and the darker blue of the sky.</td>', 'Bumping up a pont after second look. I like the blue lights of the bridge and the darker blue of the sky.', '2005-11-11 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859581, 253139, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up two points after a second look. Nice composition and good colors</td>', 'Bumping up two points after a second look. Nice composition and good colors', '2005-11-11 23:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859584, 254333, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the subject matter itself doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in this challenge. I do like how you kept the one sign in red. I wonder how this would look with a bit more contrast and brightness?</td>', 'For me, the subject matter itself doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in this challenge. I do like how you kept the one sign in red. I wonder how this would look with a bit more contrast and brightness?', '2005-11-12 00:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859586, 253889, 41675, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought perhaps you added the DENIED text. Since your photo has been validated, I think maybe someone else wondered the same thing. I like your concept, but for me, it''s the choice of background color that made me give you a lower score. I wonder how this would have looked with a darker background instead?</td>', 'At first, I thought perhaps you added the DENIED text. Since your photo has been validated, I think maybe someone else wondered the same thing. I like your concept, but for me, it''s the choice of background color that made me give you a lower score. I wonder how this would have looked with a darker background instead?', '2005-11-12 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859588, 254124, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat catch of the flame. I wonder how many matches you went through. Hopefully you weren''t near any smoke alarms while setting this up (ha ha). It appears just a bit pixelated here and there on my screen, but good job overall.</td>', 'Neat catch of the flame. I wonder how many matches you went through. Hopefully you weren''t near any smoke alarms while setting this up (ha ha). It appears just a bit pixelated here and there on my screen, but good job overall.', '2005-11-12 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859592, 254562, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. Funny entry. Too bad there wasn''t also a bug with it''s legs in the air to add a bit more interest.</td>', 'Tee hee. Funny entry. Too bad there wasn''t also a bug with it''s legs in the air to add a bit more interest.', '2005-11-12 00:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859595, 251862, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of your photo. It''s the blur and a bit too much grain for my tastes that made me give it a lower score.</td>', 'I like the composition of your photo. It''s the blur and a bit too much grain for my tastes that made me give it a lower score.', '2005-11-12 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859597, 254446, 41675, '<td valign="top">Rather than a dead end, the first thing that came to mind was some David Blaine-like magician. I think it''s the red lighting and fog. I have a feeling this will do well with many of the voters.</td>', 'Rather than a dead end, the first thing that came to mind was some David Blaine-like magician. I think it''s the red lighting and fog. I have a feeling this will do well with many of the voters.', '2005-11-12 00:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859601, 254442, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your concept. For me though, there are too many other distractions in your photo such as the bottom wires and foliage (even though I know it''s sometimes difficult to avoid that stuff) :-) I wonder how this would look with a bit more color saturation and brightness?</td>', 'I like your concept. For me though, there are too many other distractions in your photo such as the bottom wires and foliage (even though I know it''s sometimes difficult to avoid that stuff) :-) I wonder how this would look with a bit more color saturation and brightness?', '2005-11-12 00:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859603, 253272, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I think this is a nice photo, because my eyes travel past the dock to the waters and mountains beyond, for me...it doesn''t quite work as a "dead end" and I have therefore given it a lower score.</td>', 'While I think this is a nice photo, because my eyes travel past the dock to the waters and mountains beyond, for me...it doesn''t quite work as a "dead end" and I have therefore given it a lower score.', '2005-11-12 00:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859607, 254256, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up after second look. I like the color choices and composition. Gives me kind of an eerie feel when I look at it.</td>', 'Bumping up after second look. I like the color choices and composition. Gives me kind of an eerie feel when I look at it.', '2005-11-12 00:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859609, 254360, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and composition. I think with a few simple changes it could work even better. For one, the background seems very grainy to me and I think maybe a solid black would have been better. Also, the light source is a bit harsh on the cigarettes and dish. I don''t have expensive lighting equipment, but I sometimes find by taking the shade off the lamp it helps a bit. I like the creativity you show.</td>', 'I like your idea and composition. I think with a few simple changes it could work even better. For one, the background seems very grainy to me and I think maybe a solid black would have been better. Also, the light source is a bit harsh on the cigarettes and dish. I don''t have expensive lighting equipment, but I sometimes find by taking the shade off the lamp it helps a bit. I like the creativity you show.', '2005-11-12 00:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859611, 254424, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the sunset colors in the background. The flash is a bit harsh on the sign, but I know that''s how the reflectives work. Bumping up a point after a second look.</td>', 'I like the sunset colors in the background. The flash is a bit harsh on the sign, but I know that''s how the reflectives work. Bumping up a point after a second look.', '2005-11-12 00:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859614, 254518, 41675, '<td valign="top">I gave out two 10s in this challenge and this would be my pick for first place. I absolutely love it. It cracked me up. Colors are terrific and it''s easily recognizable. Good luck!</td>', 'I gave out two 10s in this challenge and this would be my pick for first place. I absolutely love it. It cracked me up. Colors are terrific and it''s easily recognizable. Good luck!', '2005-11-12 00:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859617, 254082, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, ha....rofl...I only gave out two 10s and your photo is one of them. Very, very cool. I want that fisherman duck! Where on earth did you get it?? Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ha, ha, ha....rofl...I only gave out two 10s and your photo is one of them. Very, very cool. I want that fisherman duck! Where on earth did you get it?? Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-12 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859716, 254368, 39158, '<td valign="top">nice shot, with very interesting subject</td>', 'nice shot, with very interesting subject', '2005-11-12 01:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859717, 254022, 39158, '<td valign="top">the haze is a nice touch to this shot</td>', 'the haze is a nice touch to this shot', '2005-11-12 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
