(1860292, 254497, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I do see the "end of the road", my eyes travel further into your picture to the mountains in the background. For me, your photo is a bit too dark overall. I would have liked to seen a bit more contrast or saturation. I also wonder how this would look with more of the bottom cropped out?</td>', 'While I do see the "end of the road", my eyes travel further into your picture to the mountains in the background. For me, your photo is a bit too dark overall. I would have liked to seen a bit more contrast or saturation. I also wonder how this would look with more of the bottom cropped out?', '2005-11-12 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860294, 253256, 41675, '<td valign="top">You have captured such vibrant colors. I think it''s a terrific fall shot, but if someone showed me this photo and asked me to guess a category, I would never think of "Dead End." Therefore, even though I think it''s a great shot I have given it a lower score.</td>', 'You have captured such vibrant colors. I think it''s a terrific fall shot, but if someone showed me this photo and asked me to guess a category, I would never think of "Dead End." Therefore, even though I think it''s a great shot I have given it a lower score.', '2005-11-12 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860295, 253664, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo gives me a retro 1960s kind of feel. I think it''s the woman''s coat and car. Bumping up after second look.</td>', 'Your photo gives me a retro 1960s kind of feel. I think it''s the woman''s coat and car. Bumping up after second look.', '2005-11-12 11:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860298, 254451, 41675, '<td valign="top">On my first vote through, I didn''t "get it." Looking at your photo again, I think I understand the message you''re trying to convey. Bumping up a point.</td>', 'On my first vote through, I didn''t "get it." Looking at your photo again, I think I understand the message you''re trying to convey. Bumping up a point.', '2005-11-12 11:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860300, 254519, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great sports shot. For me, it doesn''t say "dead end" as well as other entries, but it''s a cool shot. I like how his checkered boxers match the border of the cement wall. Ha ha</td>', 'Great sports shot. For me, it doesn''t say "dead end" as well as other entries, but it''s a cool shot. I like how his checkered boxers match the border of the cement wall. Ha ha', '2005-11-12 11:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860302, 254482, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hope they had a fun time. The gentleman on the left seems a bit blurry, and too bad about the flash glare here and there.  I wonder if you kept her eyes red intentionally?</td>', 'Hope they had a fun time. The gentleman on the left seems a bit blurry, and too bad about the flash glare here and there.  I wonder if you kept her eyes red intentionally?', '2005-11-12 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860304, 254510, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but compared with others in the challenge, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as long. My eyes keep getting tricked and  it looks like the leafless tree is "growing" out of the stop sign itself.</td>', 'I like the shot, but compared with others in the challenge, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as long. My eyes keep getting tricked and  it looks like the leafless tree is "growing" out of the stop sign itself.', '2005-11-12 11:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
