(1860315, 254033, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the two leaves in the middle, but the one on the upper left seems a bit...overly colored, or something - sorry, I''m not that good with the technical stuff.</td>', 'I like the two leaves in the middle, but the one on the upper left seems a bit...overly colored, or something - sorry, I''m not that good with the technical stuff.', '2005-11-12 11:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
