(1860320, 253802, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action capture on the waves. For me, it doesn''t fit the dead end category as well as other entries. I also wish there was either more color contrast or that this was a black and white. It''s a bit too muted for my tastes.</td>', 'Nice stop action capture on the waves. For me, it doesn''t fit the dead end category as well as other entries. I also wish there was either more color contrast or that this was a black and white. It''s a bit too muted for my tastes.', '2005-11-12 12:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
