(1860845, 254077, 35602, '<td valign="top">Applying a noise reducing program such as neat image would have gotten rid of much of the gray speckling, called noise, which is rampant in this image.  I would like to see it much smoother.  I do like the contrast of light and shadow on this one, and you did a very nice compositional direction with the cube.</td>', 'Applying a noise reducing program such as neat image would have gotten rid of much of the gray speckling, called noise, which is rampant in this image.  I would like to see it much smoother.  I do like the contrast of light and shadow on this one, and you did a very nice compositional direction with the cube.', '2005-11-12 16:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1860848, 253692, 36006, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the impression of a dead end.<br/> <br/>the street is distracting, color nice, bg distracting, lighting ok, texture nice, angle not interesting, what am I looking at the hole in the tree? comp needs work then, blacks good, whites barely in,</td>', 'I don''t get the impression of a dead end. the street is distracting, color nice, bg distracting, lighting ok, texture nice, angle not interesting, what am I looking at the hole in the tree? comp needs work then, blacks good, whites barely in,', '2005-11-12 16:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
