(1861061, 253497, 39483, '<td valign="top">Very well captured image. The bottle neck almost pops out of the photo. Good composition and great lighting!</td>', 'Very well captured image. The bottle neck almost pops out of the photo. Good composition and great lighting!', '2005-11-12 18:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
