(1861066, 254502, 39483, '<td valign="top">good photo but perhaps a lower angle closer to the ground would create even more of a surrounded and locked in feeling?</td>', 'good photo but perhaps a lower angle closer to the ground would create even more of a surrounded and locked in feeling?', '2005-11-12 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861069, 254237, 39483, '<td valign="top">good idea for a photo. I wonder if a black and white would create more of a ''dead end'' feel to the photo. The vibrant colors seem to take away from the mood of the interesting house. Nice texture on the house by the way!</td>', 'good idea for a photo. I wonder if a black and white would create more of a ''dead end'' feel to the photo. The vibrant colors seem to take away from the mood of the interesting house. Nice texture on the house by the way!', '2005-11-12 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861074, 254028, 39483, '<td valign="top">Good DOF. I wonder if a hand reaching over the boulder from the ''cliff'' would create more intensity?  Well exposed by the way!</td>', 'Good DOF. I wonder if a hand reaching over the boulder from the ''cliff'' would create more intensity?  Well exposed by the way!', '2005-11-12 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
