(1861215, 254236, 3214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I''m not convinced the trail doesn''t continue despite your skillful comp.Won''t hurt your score much though.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I''m not convinced the trail doesn''t continue despite your skillful comp.Won''t hurt your score much though.', '2005-11-12 20:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
