(1861244, 254478, 3214, '<td valign="top">Gosh, I like this one.  Nicely moodly, dramatic lighting and says "dead end" without the horrible text.</td>', 'Gosh, I like this one.  Nicely moodly, dramatic lighting and says "dead end" without the horrible text.', '2005-11-12 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
