(1861339, 254515, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors andI like that you offset the man to the side and didn''t put him in the center. It adds more interest.</td>', 'Beautiful colors andI like that you offset the man to the side and didn''t put him in the center. It adds more interest.', '2005-11-12 21:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
