(1861375, 253964, 3306, '<td valign="top">The birds add interest to your picture. I wish the sky was more cloudy and textured. It would add dimension to the picture but that is out of your control.</td>', 'The birds add interest to your picture. I wish the sky was more cloudy and textured. It would add dimension to the picture but that is out of your control.', '2005-11-12 22:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
