(1861510, 254068, 44086, '<td valign="top">Really interesting border but I think the border detracts. If you replicate a mat by inserting a small white line around the pic, I think you''ll get the drama you''re after.</td>', 'Really interesting border but I think the border detracts. If you replicate a mat by inserting a small white line around the pic, I think you''ll get the drama you''re after.', '2005-11-13 00:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
