(1861765, 252988, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha...very clever.  Very creative idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Hahahaha...very clever.  Very creative idea for this challenge.', '2005-11-13 05:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861767, 252884, 27133, '<td valign="top">Now this one would have to be a ribbon contender.  Well done.</td>', 'Now this one would have to be a ribbon contender.  Well done.', '2005-11-13 05:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861768, 254354, 27133, '<td valign="top">How cute!!!  I like it.</td>', 'How cute!!!  I like it.', '2005-11-13 05:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861788, 254518, 10858, '<td valign="top">Humorous capture, very well presented. I love the idea, which is surely creative for this challenge and the colours as well. As I am a summer phanatic, autumn also means me the end of the best days of a year. <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Humorous capture, very well presented. I love the idea, which is surely creative for this challenge and the colours as well. As I am a summer phanatic, autumn also means me the end of the best days of a year. Good luck!', '2005-11-13 07:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861789, 253889, 10858, '<td valign="top">Once I had a similar idea about visas for On the edge challenge. It did not finish well, but I hope yours does better. I like the DENIED text on the shot. The background is wild, I would use somewhat more official colour and a tighter crop (no matter if edges and parts get outside the photo) and a lower angle to make the shot more interesting and gove a perspective.</td>', 'Once I had a similar idea about visas for On the edge challenge. It did not finish well, but I hope yours does better. I like the DENIED text on the shot. The background is wild, I would use somewhat more official colour and a tighter crop (no matter if edges and parts get outside the photo) and a lower angle to make the shot more interesting and gove a perspective.', '2005-11-13 07:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861790, 254480, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition and B&amp;W. PhotoShop effect is though, too much much for me. For my taste, cleaner smoke and not that oversharpened face would do better. Maybe a darker background would highligt the smoke better.</td>', 'Great composition and B&W. PhotoShop effect is though, too much much for me. For my taste, cleaner smoke and not that oversharpened face would do better. Maybe a darker background would highligt the smoke better.', '2005-11-13 07:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861793, 253294, 10858, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours! I don''t like the road sign anyway, maybe because of the yellows. Maybe a no-drive-in sign or end-of-the-street table would fit better. Alltogether, the light of nature is simply stunning.</td>', 'Amazing colours! I don''t like the road sign anyway, maybe because of the yellows. Maybe a no-drive-in sign or end-of-the-street table would fit better. Alltogether, the light of nature is simply stunning.', '2005-11-13 07:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861794, 252441, 10858, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but I don''t think this is the best perspective for it, I miss the way that leads to the end. I would take a low angle and swallow DOF, highlighting one of the graves well. Maybe the further one, not the closer one, this way DOF would surely highlight to the end, the far side of the photo, which stops my eyes. Just an idea.</td>', 'The idea is good, but I don''t think this is the best perspective for it, I miss the way that leads to the end. I would take a low angle and swallow DOF, highlighting one of the graves well. Maybe the further one, not the closer one, this way DOF would surely highlight to the end, the far side of the photo, which stops my eyes. Just an idea.', '2005-11-13 07:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861796, 254424, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. For me, there is too much black, I would look a bit upper with the objective to show more of the sky and less of the blacks. Maybe, exposure a few minutes before you did would show us more colours, too. I guess you used a flash here, which is always a good idea when you take photos of close stuff in dark, but need the far background as well.</td>', 'Nice idea. For me, there is too much black, I would look a bit upper with the objective to show more of the sky and less of the blacks. Maybe, exposure a few minutes before you did would show us more colours, too. I guess you used a flash here, which is always a good idea when you take photos of close stuff in dark, but need the far background as well.', '2005-11-13 07:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861800, 253499, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a nature capture! I wonder how you found so many bugs at one place. The one with the open wings makes the photo live, I also like composition and DOF. A photo which has a true story, good luck!</td>', 'Wow, what a nature capture! I wonder how you found so many bugs at one place. The one with the open wings makes the photo live, I also like composition and DOF. A photo which has a true story, good luck!', '2005-11-13 07:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861801, 254530, 10858, '<td valign="top">The cat''s eyes are a bit dark, I would like a little light in her eyes, This way she looks a bit unliving. Also, the photo is a bit dark and our of contrast, maybe because of the bad weather. Shallower DOF would have helped you to get rid of the distracting business of the background. On the other side, the composition is nice, and the idea is unique. It''s hard to take photos of cats, because they do their very best to spoil your composition (I know,because I have tried so many times). Try, and try, and you will get better and better photos.</td>', 'The cat''s eyes are a bit dark, I would like a little light in her eyes, This way she looks a bit unliving. Also, the photo is a bit dark and our of contrast, maybe because of the bad weather. Shallower DOF would have helped you to get rid of the distracting business of the background. On the other side, the composition is nice, and the idea is unique. It''s hard to take photos of cats, because they do their very best to spoil your composition (I know,because I have tried so many times). Try, and try, and you will get better and better photos.', '2005-11-13 07:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861824, 254451, 32767, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a flash like effect making these guys stand out strangely from their background. The focus could be stronger, the light pole is the sharpest thing within frame.</td>', 'There seems to be a flash like effect making these guys stand out strangely from their background. The focus could be stronger, the light pole is the sharpest thing within frame.', '2005-11-13 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861826, 253887, 32767, '<td valign="top">The additional blurring around the center seems to be more of a distraction to me than a way to hightlight the main subject. The lighting is a little brash.Good subject ...a real Dead End.</td>', 'The additional blurring around the center seems to be more of a distraction to me than a way to hightlight the main subject. The lighting is a little brash.Good subject ...a real Dead End.', '2005-11-13 08:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
