(1861833, 254478, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you a 10 for the toning alone and for bringing what could have been a super dull image to life. Well done. Good Luck!<br/> <br/>BTW PM me and let me know what filter combo you used. Thanx.</td>', 'I''ll give you a 10 for the toning alone and for bringing what could have been a super dull image to life. Well done. Good Luck! BTW PM me and let me know what filter combo you used. Thanx.', '2005-11-13 08:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861834, 253777, 32767, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The image could have used a bit of post processing help in my opinion. Perhaps greater contrast, saturation and a dash of sharpening.</td>', 'I like the composition. The image could have used a bit of post processing help in my opinion. Perhaps greater contrast, saturation and a dash of sharpening.', '2005-11-13 08:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861850, 251665, 38032, '<td valign="top">wow - scary - i think this passes for a dead end - and a fave! I also like that the "imperfections" are left in the fur.  7</td>', 'wow - scary - i think this passes for a dead end - and a fave! I also like that the "imperfections" are left in the fur.  7', '2005-11-13 09:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861851, 253837, 38032, '<td valign="top">i''m gonna guess that this is getting a low score.  however, i thin k i get it.  i''m not sure.  Anyway: 8</td>', 'i''m gonna guess that this is getting a low score.  however, i thin k i get it.  i''m not sure.  Anyway: 8', '2005-11-13 09:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
