(1861866, 254562, 42198, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused. What is this object? - And what does ''Raiddd'' mean? - Update: Bumped vote. Thanks for the explanation!</td>', 'I''m a bit confused. What is this object? - And what does ''Raiddd'' mean? - Update: Bumped vote. Thanks for the explanation!', '2005-11-13 09:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861937, 253575, 47575, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing image. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very disturbing image. Nicely done.', '2005-11-13 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862061, 254253, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great Image.  Love the composition and the angle you took. So glad you included the  "No" over the door (by the exit) really adds to the overall feel of the shot.  Great job</td>', 'Great Image.  Love the composition and the angle you took. So glad you included the  "No" over the door (by the exit) really adds to the overall feel of the shot.  Great job', '2005-11-13 12:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862062, 254411, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great job with a shot that could have been too busy if done differently.  Instead you nailed the image with the dof and spot on focus.  Well Done</td>', 'Great job with a shot that could have been too busy if done differently.  Instead you nailed the image with the dof and spot on focus.  Well Done', '2005-11-13 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862063, 253775, 40977, '<td valign="top">No denying this dead end.  The grittiness adds to the overall feel of the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'No denying this dead end.  The grittiness adds to the overall feel of the shot.  Well done.', '2005-11-13 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862065, 254480, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great focus and love the off centered image.  The border is a bit large for such an unimpossing image.  IMO it would have worked better to stand alone without any border.  Great title....and the image.  Nice work</td>', 'Great focus and love the off centered image.  The border is a bit large for such an unimpossing image.  IMO it would have worked better to stand alone without any border.  Great title....and the image.  Nice work', '2005-11-13 12:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862067, 254360, 40977, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the image.  I do think there could have been something done with the image for it to be a bit more eye pleasing.  Everything is there focus, composition, and message.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the image.  I do think there could have been something done with the image for it to be a bit more eye pleasing.  Everything is there focus, composition, and message.', '2005-11-13 12:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862069, 254442, 40977, '<td valign="top">There is something you don''t see everyday.  Great catch.  Fits the challenge.  Focus is spot great and I like the composition.  Maybe a bit tighter shot since mose of the landscape is cut off anyhow.  Regardless well done.</td>', 'There is something you don''t see everyday.  Great catch.  Fits the challenge.  Focus is spot great and I like the composition.  Maybe a bit tighter shot since mose of the landscape is cut off anyhow.  Regardless well done.', '2005-11-13 12:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862073, 253569, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the color-- looks like the forest is on fire.  Great eye to catch this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Love the color-- looks like the forest is on fire.  Great eye to catch this shot.  Well done.', '2005-11-13 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862076, 253650, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the selective desat.  Great shot...focus, composition, and fits the challenge.  Really well done.</td>', 'Love the selective desat.  Great shot...focus, composition, and fits the challenge.  Really well done.', '2005-11-13 12:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862079, 253272, 40977, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there....dead end or not.  Great shot.  The clouds look so close you could touch them.  Great dof and spot on focus.  Well done.</td>', 'Wish I was there....dead end or not.  Great shot.  The clouds look so close you could touch them.  Great dof and spot on focus.  Well done.', '2005-11-13 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862084, 254422, 40977, '<td valign="top">It fits the challenge, but maybe another angle or vantage point where the gate wasn''t such a distraction or the shot wasn''t so busy with cars and nearby gas station/shops would have produced a more powerfull image.</td>', 'It fits the challenge, but maybe another angle or vantage point where the gate wasn''t such a distraction or the shot wasn''t so busy with cars and nearby gas station/shops would have produced a more powerfull image.', '2005-11-13 12:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862086, 254531, 40977, '<td valign="top">Spot on Focus and great details shown in the rope.  The brilliant shades of yellow and red in the rope twine and the frayed ends add character to a shot that could have easily been boring.  Very Well Done --8--  ((bump)) --9--</td>', 'Spot on Focus and great details shown in the rope.  The brilliant shades of yellow and red in the rope twine and the frayed ends add character to a shot that could have easily been boring.  Very Well Done --8--  ((bump)) --9--', '2005-11-13 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862090, 254237, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great eye!!  You''ve taken an image and made it into a story all it''s own.  The only thing I wish was done differently was a bit more of the house/cabin and less of the pond and trail behind.  There might have been a reason you cut off the building...I have to imagine there was.  Great image. --8--</td>', 'Great eye!!  You''ve taken an image and made it into a story all it''s own.  The only thing I wish was done differently was a bit more of the house/cabin and less of the pond and trail behind.  There might have been a reason you cut off the building...I have to imagine there was.  Great image. --8--', '2005-11-13 12:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862093, 254475, 40977, '<td valign="top">Simple, Soft and lovely .....well done</td>', 'Simple, Soft and lovely .....well done', '2005-11-13 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862108, 254480, 33947, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, positioning and perspective. Very effective shot. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Excellent lighting, positioning and perspective. Very effective shot. One of my favorites.', '2005-11-13 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862116, 254144, 33947, '<td valign="top">Coloration and lighting are very well done. Good compositon. Sad, though. 10</td>', 'Coloration and lighting are very well done. Good compositon. Sad, though. 10', '2005-11-13 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862120, 254033, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice, vivid colors. Great contrast. Like the simplicity.</td>', 'Nice, vivid colors. Great contrast. Like the simplicity.', '2005-11-13 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862127, 254205, 33947, '<td valign="top">Effective compositon with great line. Like the simplicity of it. Well thought through. 10</td>', 'Effective compositon with great line. Like the simplicity of it. Well thought through. 10', '2005-11-13 12:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862130, 254068, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective here, and the dark graininess. Nice composition.</td>', 'Love the perspective here, and the dark graininess. Nice composition.', '2005-11-13 13:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
