(1862370, 253341, 35444, '<td valign="top">This is very emotive.  I love the light and shadows (dodging/burning?) and the colors.  Well done!</td>', 'This is very emotive.  I love the light and shadows (dodging/burning?) and the colors.  Well done!', '2005-11-13 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862406, 254477, 45324, '<td valign="top">Nice shotting!</td>', 'Nice shotting!', '2005-11-13 16:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862445, 253294, 4517, '<td valign="top">Stunning 10.</td>', 'Stunning 10.', '2005-11-13 16:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862934, 253902, 4493, '<td valign="top">I think your angle and composition are very busy. I don''t have a main focal point in this image to keep me. Perhaps another angle with less clutter in the shot would improve the sense of dead end/new life.</td>', 'I think your angle and composition are very busy. I don''t have a main focal point in this image to keep me. Perhaps another angle with less clutter in the shot would improve the sense of dead end/new life.', '2005-11-13 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862937, 253575, 4493, '<td valign="top">Powerful image and well executed. The over contrast and saturation work well to convey the emotion.</td>', 'Powerful image and well executed. The over contrast and saturation work well to convey the emotion.', '2005-11-13 19:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862940, 253833, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the person in the shot. It makes it more meaningful than just a series of doorways. I think that a reflector to bounce some light onto the subject so he doesn''t get lost in the darkness would help improve that area of the image.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the person in the shot. It makes it more meaningful than just a series of doorways. I think that a reflector to bounce some light onto the subject so he doesn''t get lost in the darkness would help improve that area of the image.', '2005-11-13 19:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862950, 253139, 4493, '<td valign="top">This image does convey dead end, but I feel that the soft focus and blown out sky distract from the ''dead end''. In this case moving the camera such that it doesn''t have the sky in the shot, maybe just the tree line behind it would help the viewer stay at the dock rather than the bright sky moving their eyes away from it.</td>', 'This image does convey dead end, but I feel that the soft focus and blown out sky distract from the ''dead end''. In this case moving the camera such that it doesn''t have the sky in the shot, maybe just the tree line behind it would help the viewer stay at the dock rather than the bright sky moving their eyes away from it.', '2005-11-13 20:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862960, 252553, 4493, '<td valign="top">nice leading line. The road does not appear to dead end, just end. The focus also appears to be soft to me.</td>', 'nice leading line. The road does not appear to dead end, just end. The focus also appears to be soft to me.', '2005-11-13 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862966, 254531, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. The lighting adds nicely. I am on a laptop so the brightness is ok on it, but I feel that people on CRT monitors may feel the image to be lit too darkly.</td>', 'Very good composition. The lighting adds nicely. I am on a laptop so the brightness is ok on it, but I feel that people on CRT monitors may feel the image to be lit too darkly.', '2005-11-13 20:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862970, 254144, 4493, '<td valign="top">erm, is this a dead rat? Guess that''s a dead end alright.</td>', 'erm, is this a dead rat? Guess that''s a dead end alright.', '2005-11-13 20:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862975, 252554, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at, but the spiraling seems to suggest a tunnel not a dead end.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at, but the spiraling seems to suggest a tunnel not a dead end.', '2005-11-13 20:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862984, 253994, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures in this shot. I do think it may be stronger with the text at the top cropped out.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures in this shot. I do think it may be stronger with the text at the top cropped out.', '2005-11-13 20:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862987, 253692, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice autumn shot, but the road doesn''t feel like it''s running into a dead end to me. It also seems to have a tilt to the left on the horizon.</td>', 'Nice autumn shot, but the road doesn''t feel like it''s running into a dead end to me. It also seems to have a tilt to the left on the horizon.', '2005-11-13 20:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862991, 254368, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good composition and handling of wide dynamic range of light. Should score high for originality.</td>', 'Good composition and handling of wide dynamic range of light. Should score high for originality.', '2005-11-13 20:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863025, 254079, 4493, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the mood you''re trying to convey here, but I think the burning is a little over the top. A black and white treatment may also bring a darker ''dead end'' feeling to it.</td>', 'I can appreciate the mood you''re trying to convey here, but I think the burning is a little over the top. A black and white treatment may also bring a darker ''dead end'' feeling to it.', '2005-11-13 20:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863031, 252976, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great b/w treatment. The composition is strong and prevokes thought. Well done.</td>', 'Great b/w treatment. The composition is strong and prevokes thought. Well done.', '2005-11-13 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863087, 254370, 4493, '<td valign="top">Seeing the road off to the left. I''d have positioned the camera so the sign on the right wasn''t in the frame. It doesn''t add to your message here. I also feel that the sky treatment may be a little too strong.</td>', 'Seeing the road off to the left. I''d have positioned the camera so the sign on the right wasn''t in the frame. It doesn''t add to your message here. I also feel that the sky treatment may be a little too strong.', '2005-11-13 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1863103, 254236, 4493, '<td valign="top">Harsh light is the biggest thing of note here. May want to revisit this shot in sunrise/set lighting. Composition is ok, but I don''t get an overly strong feeling of Dead End here.<br/></td>', 'Harsh light is the biggest thing of note here. May want to revisit this shot in sunrise/set lighting. Composition is ok, but I don''t get an overly strong feeling of Dead End here.', '2005-11-13 20:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863137, 254518, 22872, '<td valign="top">do I recognize this yellow brick road and ruby red shoes? :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'do I recognize this yellow brick road and ruby red shoes? :) ', '2005-11-13 21:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863145, 254325, 42198, '<td valign="top">Image looks noisy, like it''s over-compressed or something (perhaps when you were resizing in PS?). The grey border doesn''t really add to it. There''s also no main focus... Is it the gate or that column in the middle?<br/> <br/>The lighting is okay though. Overall I would have preferred to see one main subject. If it''s the gate, then change where you''re standing to focus the attention on it.</td>', 'Image looks noisy, like it''s over-compressed or something (perhaps when you were resizing in PS?). The grey border doesn''t really add to it. There''s also no main focus... Is it the gate or that column in the middle? The lighting is okay though. Overall I would have preferred to see one main subject. If it''s the gate, then change where you''re standing to focus the attention on it.', '2005-11-13 21:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863149, 252651, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is a bit confusing. I can''t really see where the street is. I''m not sure what I''m looking at, is it a fence? Or a gate?</td>', 'This is a bit confusing. I can''t really see where the street is. I''m not sure what I''m looking at, is it a fence? Or a gate?', '2005-11-13 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863150, 254518, 42198, '<td valign="top">My fav of the challenge. Well thought out, imaginative. I hope no witches were harmed in the making of that shot...</td>', 'My fav of the challenge. Well thought out, imaginative. I hope no witches were harmed in the making of that shot...', '2005-11-13 21:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863151, 253499, 42198, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture. Colours are great, focus and DOF are just right.</td>', 'An excellent capture. Colours are great, focus and DOF are just right.', '2005-11-13 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863152, 254354, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is just so weird, I really like it!</td>', 'This is just so weird, I really like it!', '2005-11-13 21:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863307, 254237, 39057, '<td valign="top">Great great shot! If it was free study I would give a 10. I wish I could lump in to the dead end theme but I can''t. 7</td>', 'Great great shot! If it was free study I would give a 10. I wish I could lump in to the dead end theme but I can''t. 7', '2005-11-13 22:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863419, 254312, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is complete in so many ways. It is a pleasant eye full of the moments of the hunt which remains a universal concept of the human race. detail and colors are simply rich. bumping.</td>', 'This image is complete in so many ways. It is a pleasant eye full of the moments of the hunt which remains a universal concept of the human race. detail and colors are simply rich. bumping.', '2005-11-13 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863424, 253575, 22734, '<td valign="top">The topic of desperation very well presented.</td>', 'The topic of desperation very well presented.', '2005-11-13 23:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863429, 253625, 22734, '<td valign="top">An exemplifarion of the usual dead ends that we all tend to gravitate to as a sum result of our actions or actions from without that leaves us crushed.</td>', 'An exemplifarion of the usual dead ends that we all tend to gravitate to as a sum result of our actions or actions from without that leaves us crushed.', '2005-11-13 23:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
