(1863991, 253958, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, this is a nice welcome surprise (the final numbers that is)!  ;^)  Some questions as to the composition and why the entire wagon isn''t there - the wagon tongue has a post holding it up that I found unattractive and distracting...so I composed without it.  From the angle of view I needed to keep it in the image and hoped it would act as a leading line?  This POV also allowed me to include the sky which added some nice color with the sloping tree line.<br/> <br/>Anyway, for those that liked it - thanks.  And for ALL that commented thanks to you as well.</td>', 'Well, this is a nice welcome surprise (the final numbers that is)!  ;^)  Some questions as to the composition and why the entire wagon isn''t there - the wagon tongue has a post holding it up that I found unattractive and distracting...so I composed without it.  From the angle of view I needed to keep it in the image and hoped it would act as a leading line?  This POV also allowed me to include the sky which added some nice color with the sloping tree line. Anyway, for those that liked it - thanks.  And for ALL that commented thanks to you as well.', '2005-11-14 01:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
