(1864383, 252884, 31889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/> <br/>My original idea was to place the ant on a straw which would be placed in a glass of juice or milk or some other liquid.  I couldn''t decide what liquid to use and so took the easy way out.  A blade of grass!  The first ant kept crawling down the grass when I wanted him to go up, (the shot was rotated), so after a moment of misplaced frustration it was time to find a new ant.  The second one played the game by the rules and four shots later we let him go back in the garden.<br/> <br/>Guess I was lucky with this one.<br/> <br/>bazz.<br/> <br/>Ohh and to arpita...thanks for scaring the beejeezus outta me with your ribbon call 35 mins into voting. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-14 07:37:03.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments. My original idea was to place the ant on a straw which would be placed in a glass of juice or milk or some other liquid.  I couldn''t decide what liquid to use and so took the easy way out.  A blade of grass!  The first ant kept crawling down the grass when I wanted him to go up, (the shot was rotated), so after a moment of misplaced frustration it was time to find a new ant.  The second one played the game by the rules and four shots later we let him go back in the garden. Guess I was lucky with this one. bazz. Ohh and to arpita...thanks for scaring the beejeezus outta me with your ribbon call 35 mins into voting. :)', '2005-11-14 07:29:25.000000', '2005-11-14 07:37:03.000000', 0),
(1864417, 254531, 32033, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all the comments.  THis photo has replaced my 2nd highest rated photo.  This is the first time I used lighting to take a photo.  I made it dark because of the subject.  I also was not going to enter the challenge because I could not think of a good title, but then at the last minute Knot a Good Idea popped into my head.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for all the comments.  THis photo has replaced my 2nd highest rated photo.  This is the first time I used lighting to take a photo.  I made it dark because of the subject.  I also was not going to enter the challenge because I could not think of a good title, but then at the last minute Knot a Good Idea popped into my head. Thanks again.', '2005-11-14 07:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
