(1864535, 253775, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''ll echo what ubique said (and also gave it a 5). The concept is strong (and certainly meets the challenge), but it''s going to make the viewer uncomfortable and more likely to look for a reason to score it low... harsh lighting, grittiness, etc.<br/> <br/>P.S. I told my daughter that it''s not a popsicle or a zipper and she said, "Oooooh, it''s a road!" (a toy section of track). "She''s eating the road, so that''s the dead end for the cars." LOL</td>', 'I''ll echo what ubique said (and also gave it a 5). The concept is strong (and certainly meets the challenge), but it''s going to make the viewer uncomfortable and more likely to look for a reason to score it low... harsh lighting, grittiness, etc. P.S. I told my daughter that it''s not a popsicle or a zipper and she said, "Oooooh, it''s a road!" (a toy section of track). "She''s eating the road, so that''s the dead end for the cars." LOL', '2005-11-14 09:33:05.000000', NULL, 0),
