(1866729, 254518, 47117, '<td valign="top">HOLLLLY COW! Well, that WAS a lot of work. I was just mentioning on another site how much some of us really do for a good turnout in a contest so it is sad when someone low balls you in voting. I can''t BELIEVE someone gave you a 3 and 4''s! I gave this a ten, and I was wondering how you did it! LOL...Now that I know, it all makes sense. Thank you.  You are a genius!!</td>', 'HOLLLLY COW! Well, that WAS a lot of work. I was just mentioning on another site how much some of us really do for a good turnout in a contest so it is sad when someone low balls you in voting. I can''t BELIEVE someone gave you a 3 and 4''s! I gave this a ten, and I was wondering how you did it! LOL...Now that I know, it all makes sense. Thank you.  You are a genius!!', '2005-11-14 21:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
