(2293278, 253223, 17454, '<td valign="top">When I frist read it I totaly saw Silence during lock up (would of been a small inside joke).  No stands???  how did you guys end up with out a stand for your light?  Its like a scrim bag they go hand and Hand.  I also work in the Lighting Department on crappy movies, well one good movie but I haven''t seen it......<br/> <br/>I find it pretty funny going through some comments people make about your set photos they have no idea at all.<br/> <br/>well back to the gel board the boss doesn''t have enough damn 1/8th ctb tweenie cuts.</td>', 'When I frist read it I totaly saw Silence during lock up (would of been a small inside joke).  No stands???  how did you guys end up with out a stand for your light?  Its like a scrim bag they go hand and Hand.  I also work in the Lighting Department on crappy movies, well one good movie but I haven''t seen it...... I find it pretty funny going through some comments people make about your set photos they have no idea at all. well back to the gel board the boss doesn''t have enough damn 1/8th ctb tweenie cuts.', '2006-04-07 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 0),
