(2953684, 253721, 67257, '<td valign="top">I agree the picture is saturated.  I however thought it was supposed to be that way.  The combination of the Road Closed signs, the broken state of the sign on the left and the over all dark tone all add to the idea of this area being long forgotten.  I personally like it.  Great job.</td>', 'I agree the picture is saturated.  I however thought it was supposed to be that way.  The combination of the Road Closed signs, the broken state of the sign on the left and the over all dark tone all add to the idea of this area being long forgotten.  I personally like it.  Great job.', '2006-10-23 08:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
